        "date": "2026-11-14T15:47:10Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(import): turn a closed STEP solid wound inward outward, and say so\n\nA closed, gap-free STEP body whose faces all wind inward has a negative\nsigned volume. The importer kept it inside out and gave no notice. Now\nthe STEP arm of the importer finds each closed body with the\npick::winding verdict InsideOut, reverses its facets, and returns a note.\nThe note goes to ImportModel.notes, the script and MCP import result\n(\"notes\") and the UI status line. Open bodies and bodies with mixed\nwinding are not changed.\n\nFixes #1617\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
